# Scene 1: Awakening 
~ awakening
[i]Black screen. The scene slowly fades in. Kaguya opens her eyes in the bamboo grove.[/i]
Kaguya: ...Where am I?
[i]Her eyes settle on the distant blue star.[/i]
Kaguya: ...What is that blue star?
[i]Almost instinctively, she reaches her hand toward it.[/i]
Kaguya: ...Why do I want to go there?
[i]She stares at it for a moment before slowly getting to her feet.[/i]
=> kodama_kiko


# Scene 2: Kodama Kiko 
~ kodama_kiko
[i]A few Kiko cautiously approach Kaguya.[/i]
Kiko: Heeey, Kaguya-! You're finally awake!
Kaguya: ...How long?
Kiko: Mhm! You were asleep for so long, I was starting to think you were dead!
Kaguya: Wait... Who are you?
Kiko: Ouch. You really don't remember me?
Kaguya: Remember...?
Kiko: Hey, don't look so scared! You've been asleep for so long, I thought you were dead!
Kiko: I'm Kiko. A Kodama spirit. I've been living around here for a very, very long time.
Kaguya: ...Kiko.
Kiko: Yep! That's me!
Kaguya: Why are you here?
Kiko: To help you, of course! I've been waiting for you to wake up.
Kaguya: ...Waiting for me? I'm so confused, like, why am I here and what...
Kiko: Hmm... let's save that part for later.
[i]Kiko tilts her head with a teasing smile.[/i]
Kiko: Well, you're standing. That's a good start.
Kaguya: ...A good start for what?
Kiko: For making yourself useful, obviously!
Kaguya: But I just woke up, huh.
Kiko: Exactly! You've had plenty of rest.
[i]Kiko smiles mischievously.[/i]
Kiko: Come on, sleepyhead. There's work to do.
Kaguya: ...Work?
[i]Kiko grins.[/i]
Kiko: You'll figure it out. Try to keep up!
[i]Kiko floats ahead.[/i]
=> END
